body.en:
Project requirements: {{requirements}}
Audience: {{audience}}
Technology constraints: {{technology}}
Visual direction: {{direction}}

Define the information structure and primary action, then build a marketing website with a coherent design language. Use relevant content and distinguish core information from decoration. Provide clear headings, value, evidence and calls to action. Add motion only when it serves a purpose. Verify mobile reading, keyboard access, form states and loading.
